  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "不動產信託",
    "sub_ename": "REAL ESTATE INVESTMENT TRUST",
    "describe_ch": "本課程的目的為介紹信託法制之基本原理，並解析現行不動產信託應用於都市更新、危老重建、以房養老、遺囑信託、履約保證、預售屋買賣與包租代管，修習課程後能應用不動產信託法制於符合社會需求之不動產信託產品。",
    "describe_eh": "The purpose of this course is to introduce the basic principles of Trust Law and to explain the application of current real estate trust products to urban renewal, reconstruction of urban unsafe and old buildings, house-for-pension scheme reverse mortgage loan, testamentary trusts, performance bonds, presold house deals and subleasing and management. Students will be able to apply Real Estate Investment Trust Law to various real estate trust products that meet the needs of society after taking this course.",
